WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.745
A weekend in Lagos, on Paystack.

2
00:00:03.942 --> 00:00:07.693
From your Nigerian brand's home, tap plus,

3
00:00:07.705 --> 00:00:09.808
choose Create event,

4
00:00:09.923 --> 00:00:11.757
then Ticketed event.

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.182
The basics don't change.

6
00:00:14.201 --> 00:00:16.485
Name it, keep it in person,

7
00:00:16.485 --> 00:00:18.137
and pick a party type.

8
00:00:19.086 --> 00:00:21.327
Add your vibe tags and every

9
00:00:21.327 --> 00:00:22.628
genre you'll play

10
00:00:22.768 --> 00:00:26.710
afrobeats, amapiano, afro house.

11
00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:30.052
They all show up as tags on your page.

12
00:00:31.026 --> 00:00:33.660
Then say how the two nights differ.

13
00:00:36.813 --> 00:00:38.007
Step two:

14
00:00:38.321 --> 00:00:40.364
choose Multi-date.

15
00:00:41.482 --> 00:00:43.434
Set the timezone first

16
00:00:43.563 --> 00:00:45.363
this weekend is in Lagos.

17
00:00:45.998 --> 00:00:49.349
Then add each day; you need at least two.

18
00:00:49.605 --> 00:00:52.031
Saturday runs nine till three,

19
00:00:52.075 --> 00:00:54.345
and Sunday is an earlier night,

20
00:00:54.451 --> 00:00:56.218
five till eleven.

21
00:00:57.118 --> 00:01:00.383
With two dates in, choose how guests pay.

22
00:01:00.686 --> 00:01:01.652
Per day:

23
00:01:01.725 --> 00:01:04.304
a separate pass for each day they pick.

24
00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.340
Step three:

25
00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:12.833
name the venue,

26
00:01:12.876 --> 00:01:14.429
search for the address,

27
00:01:14.429 --> 00:01:15.611
and pick it.

28
00:01:16.325 --> 00:01:18.070
With hide address on,

29
00:01:18.149 --> 00:01:20.834
only ticket holders see where it is.

30
00:01:25.547 --> 00:01:27.501
For the cover, choose a video.

31
00:01:28.103 --> 00:01:29.588
Once it's uploaded,

32
00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:31.754
close the sheet and keep working

33
00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.646
Mingla finishes it in the background.

34
00:01:35.426 --> 00:01:37.195
Set the theme meanwhile:

35
00:01:37.275 --> 00:01:40.339
green, Poppins, and fireworks.

36
00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.648
The preview shows each

37
00:01:42.648 --> 00:01:44.016
choice as you make it.

38
00:01:45.075 --> 00:01:47.252
Come back, and the cover is ready.

39
00:01:47.678 --> 00:01:50.224
Now add your photos, up to eight

40
00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:53.324
guests swipe through them after the video.

41
00:01:54.004 --> 00:01:55.430
Then use this cover.

42
00:02:08.713 --> 00:02:09.984
Step five:

43
00:02:10.204 --> 00:02:11.193
tickets.

44
00:02:11.476 --> 00:02:12.401
Name it,

45
00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.719
and say guests can pick Saturday,

46
00:02:14.719 --> 00:02:16.395
Sunday, or both.

47
00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:19.490
The price is in naira, per day.

48
00:02:19.961 --> 00:02:21.439
Set the capacity,

49
00:02:21.455 --> 00:02:23.879
turn on the waitlist and transfers,

50
00:02:23.899 --> 00:02:25.037
and save.

51
00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.668
Keep it public with transfers on,

52
00:02:29.745 --> 00:02:31.546
and turn on in-person

53
00:02:31.546 --> 00:02:32.953
payments for door sales.

54
00:02:36.647 --> 00:02:39.620
Step seven checks demand and competition,

55
00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:41.845
then gives you a likely range

56
00:02:41.856 --> 00:02:43.464
not a promise.

57
00:02:44.365 --> 00:02:45.188
Publish,

58
00:02:45.188 --> 00:02:47.411
and both dates go on sale at once.

59
00:02:50.113 --> 00:02:51.373
And it's live,

60
00:02:51.373 --> 00:02:52.453
in green,

61
00:02:52.459 --> 00:02:54.822
with the cover and your photos up top.

62
00:02:55.486 --> 00:02:56.619
Down in tickets,

63
00:02:56.619 --> 00:02:58.508
a guest picks their days

64
00:02:58.674 --> 00:02:59.599
tick both,

65
00:02:59.599 --> 00:03:02.124
and the total covers two passes.

66
00:03:02.811 --> 00:03:05.798
Every customer Mingla drives your way

67
00:03:05.806 --> 00:03:07.399
lands right here.
